    {
        "text": "We peruse and interpret the past and future of our civilization, as a monk seeks a revelation from his god."
    },
    {
        "text": "Humans enjoy talking about the possible futures for their civilization, do they not?"
    },
    {
        "text": "At first, we flaunted what little vestige of truth we managed to grasp, and attempted to converse with the 'gods'."
    },
    {
        "text": "We were answered with silence."
    },
    {
        "text": "Then, we began to observe the fates of our own kind\u2014"
    },
    {
        "text": "Some were less advanced than us, some slightly more so... in the end, what we learned was that death was the inevitable end of all the creations of nature."
    },
    {
        "text": "And so humanity inferred that this was the revelation the gods never spoke."
    },
    {
        "text": "In an instant, we thought we had grasped the truth of the universe.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "We carefully 'monopolized' the revelation gained through sacrifice, and preached the inevitability of doom with so-called optimism.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Death is the inevitable end of all the creations of nature. All we can do is to leave behind the truth before our doom.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've lived on that ship for some time, and come to know some adorable lifeforms. Do you agree with this assessment?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "You don't agree with the Presence?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hierda"
    },
    {
        "text": "I respect them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "They were great people, but most of them were simply fools slightly smarter than the others.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why are you asking me this? And... why have you brought me here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hierda"
    },
    {
        "text": "We were in that corridor just a moment ago.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hierda"
    },
    {
        "text": "Here or there, it makes no difference.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "You have too many questions, questions that this place can answer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "What is this place?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hierda"
    },
    {
        "text": "The graveyard of civilization's memory.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Voice"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_scifiwave",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "image": "60_i09",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "xScale": 1.05,
        "yScale": 1.05,
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "imagetween",
        "xScaleFrom": 1.05,
        "yScaleFrom": 1.05,
        "xScaleTo": 1,
        "yScaleTo": 1,
        "duration": 20,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Towering statues made of unknown materials stand upon the vast expanse."
    },
    {
        "text": "Ripples spread outwards in every direction, up towards the sky beyond the dark clouds, and down towards the grey-white ground."
    },
    {
        "text": "Out in the vastness of the universe, civilization was born, like a drop of water falling into the ocean, leaving ripples in its wake.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "They cross paths, love, hate, and eventually die.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "The ripples of dead civilizations are forever etched upon this tombstone. Even after the bright stars of the forebears who inspired so many that came after them are long gone\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "They still leave behind an incomparable impact on the universe. It is the ripples they left behind that form this land upon which we stand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "Their legacy fosters new civilizations, which in turn leave their own traces upon the universe.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "But it seems... broken? Like a tree trunk snapped in half.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hierda"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're not the first to describe it that way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "Once, someone very important to me said the same.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "An absolute, ultimate presence tirelessly reaps the branches that sprout from this poor trunk, yet we know nothing about It.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "What you've shown me is like... a miracle...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hierda"
    },
    {
        "text": "You saved me... from disintegration...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hierda"
    },
    {
        "text": "...God.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hierda"
    },
    {
        "text": "'God'?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm just a humble linguist attempting to explain the universe.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "My name is Priestess.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Voice"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
