    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1718_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1718_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "And, strictly speaking, I did not save you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Priestess"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1719_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014\u2014?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hierda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1718_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your death has already occurred. I did not intervene in the process of matter being converted to information.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Priestess"
    },
    {
        "text": "But material destruction is not true death. Information is not so easily erased, and your information was stored in Originium.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Priestess"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1719_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "B-But I can think. I felt I was living when I was on the ship. All this vivid\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hierda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1718_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "A stream of data repeated over and over.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Priestess"
    },
    {
        "text": "I intentionally left behind fragments of history in order to observe our past lives.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Priestess"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1719_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "So this is like a dream?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hierda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1718_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Dream' is vague and subjective. Do not allow language to lead you to meaningless self-doubt, before you have touched its fundamental nature.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Priestess"
    },
    {
        "text": "You may understand this as a snapshot from the past that I have recorded in the form of information.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Priestess"
    },
    {
        "text": "But it's nothing more than a still frame. There is no future for it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Priestess"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1719_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then why am I here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hierda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1718_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I saw you at the instant of your death.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Priestess"
    },
    {
        "text": "Someone disturbed me. It was a coincidence, a whim of probability.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Priestess"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1719_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "So... I'm not special.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hierda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1718_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh but you are, Hierda. You, and those like you, are very special.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Priestess"
    },
    {
        "text": "Originium has shaped you into what you are. You have interacted with Originium in wondrous ways.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Priestess"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your history and your civilization all exist because of Originium.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Priestess"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1719_1#10$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "But Originium has also brought so much pain...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hierda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1718_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes. It was a mistake. Your existence was not part of the plan.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Priestess"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1719_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "What?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hierda"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you mean that the people on Terra shouldn't exist?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hierda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1718_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, you misunderstand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Priestess"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your civilization was born of probability. Just like you, standing here right now, it exists in time on an objective basis.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Priestess"
    },
    {
        "text": "Born of probability, and lost to probability. It is the most basic rule of the universe.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Priestess"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1719_1#10$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hierda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Cautus needs time to digest it all."
    },
    {
        "text": "Originium brought destruction to her, but also consolation and infinite knowledge in this frozen time."
    },
    {
        "text": "She feels lonely, but no pain. If there is one thing right now that could cause pain, it would be\u2014"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1719_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Terra... my home...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hierda"
    },
    {
        "text": "It was not blessed by God...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hierda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
