        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Cautus continues to stand before the imposing 'gravestone'."
    },
    {
        "text": "She touches the ripples upon it and trembles."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1719_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Every mark is the end of a civilization... only now do I truly feel\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hierda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1719_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Can I stay here and learn?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hierda"
    },
    {
        "text": "You have shown me the key to the answer. I have to comprehend all this knowledge on my own.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hierda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1718_1#2$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even though this is only a fragment of time, frozen forever?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Priestess"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1719_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Yes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hierda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1718_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're very much like us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Priestess"
    },
    {
        "text": "You may roam this place and anywhere on Rhodes Island freely, to seek the answer that you crave.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Priestess"
    },
    {
        "text": "As for whether you want to stay here, or go back to the Terra that you loved so much...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Priestess"
    },
    {
        "text": "I will respect whatever choice you make. We will meet again soon.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Priestess"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1719_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Y-You're leaving? Where are you going?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hierda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1718_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Someone has been waiting for me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Priestess"
    },
    {
        "text": "...For far too long.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Priestess"
    },
